### 10. Four Industry Case Studies

Create a premium storytelling case study section, Apple/Notion style.

Each industry case study should include:

* KPI Snapshot
* Observed Problem
* FLOW Solution
* Workflow Solution
* SOP Suggestion
* COO-Approved Insight
* Summary

Case Study 1: Marketing & Advertising
Problem: Campaign execution slowed by scattered briefs, unclear approvals, and repeated revisions.
Solution: Define campaign workflow from brief → creation → review → approval → launch → reporting.
COO insight: Protect the creative team by making approvals visible before deadlines become urgent.

Case Study 2: Healthcare Administration
Problem: Scheduling, reminders, documentation, and follow-ups rely too much on manual coordination.
Solution: Map patient journey from booking → confirmation → visit prep → visit → follow-up.
COO insight: Reduce admin stress by designing the day before the day begins.

Case Study 3: Education & Learning
Problem: Lesson delivery varies too much by instructor style, making progress difficult to track.
Solution: Define lesson flow from planning → delivery → practice → feedback → progress review.
COO insight: A good teaching system protects creativity by giving it a reliable frame.

Case Study 4: Real Estate Operations
Problem: Leads and deals can be lost when follow-ups are not visible and next actions depend on memory.
Solution: Structure pipeline from lead → qualification → viewing → offer → close → nurture.
COO insight: Revenue becomes more predictable when the process is visible before the result appears.

